//! Magic multipliers for the magic slider backend (the M4 default).
//!
//! GENERATED FILE - do not edit by hand. Regenerate from the
//! repository with:
//!
//! ```sh
//! cargo run --release --example gen_magics
//! ```
//!
//! The generator (`examples/gen_magics.rs`) brute-forces these from a fixed
//! splitmix64 seed and verifies each candidate against every occupancy of its
//! line before accepting it, so a rerun reproduces this file byte for byte —
//! which CI checks on every run. These multipliers are the *only* generated
//! part of the magic backend: `magic.rs` derives each mask and shift from the
//! board geometry and const-evaluates the attack tables from there, so no
//! table is ever transcribed from elsewhere.

